include::book/09-git-and-other-scms/sections/import-svn.asc[]

include::book/09-git-and-other-scms/sections/import-custom.asc[]

=== Summary
tag::overview[]

You should now feel comfortable using Git as a bridge to other systems or importing nearly any existing project into Git without losing your precious design history.

Congratulations! You’ve mastered the daily workflows, the team collaboration on GitHub, and the art of importing the past. In the final chapter, we’ll take one last step: peeling back the UI to look at the raw **internals** of Git, so you can understand exactly how every byte of your design is stored.
